{"id":"0c6fbc9920c55fb6","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/049_Hilbert_公理演算.md","title":"049 Hilbert 公理演算","display":"049_Hilbert_公理演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表与目标差异\">1. 符号表与目标差异</h1>\n<p>命题变元集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条目定义抽象 Hilbert 公理演算框架；具体公理实例集合与有限前提规则关系在第 5 节作为带精确类型的参数给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-命题语言\">2. 命题语言</h1>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 分别表示上述两个构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{H}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{H}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换作用</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{H}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{H}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{H}(A,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{H}(A,\\sigma)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\sigma\">\\(A\\sigma\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\sigma=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\sigma=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\sigma=\\operatorname{neg}(A\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\sigma=\\operatorname{imp}(A\\sigma,B\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\sigma=\\operatorname{neg}(A\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\sigma=\\operatorname{imp}(A\\sigma,B\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{H}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{H}\\)</span> 为公式相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-大小函数\">4. 大小函数</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\cdot|_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{atom}(p)|=1,\\quad\n|\\operatorname{neg}(A)|=1+|A|,\\quad\n|\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)|=1+|A|+|B|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{atom}(p)|=1,\\quad\n|\\operatorname{neg}(A)|=1+|A|,\\quad\n|\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)|=1+|A|+|B|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理与规则参数\">5. 公理与规则参数</h1>\n<p>公理参数和规则参数分别满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>参数化 Hilbert 展示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_H=(\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H},\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_H=(\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H},\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条目是抽象框架，因此上述两个对象是显式形式参数，而不是未展开的具体逻辑名称。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-规则实例的显示形式\">6. 规则实例的显示形式</h1>\n<p>若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}),B)\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}),B)\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则对应规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A_0\\qquad\\cdots\\qquad A_{n-1}}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A_0\\qquad\\cdots\\qquad A_{n-1}}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>零前提元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((),B)\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}\">\\(((),B)\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}\\)</span> 许可一个无前提规则结论；公理实例放在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\">\\(\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\\)</span> 中。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_H\">\\(\\mathcal P_H\\)</span>-Hilbert 证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 满足下列一种条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\">\\(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与指标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:m\\to k\">\\(j:m\\to k\\)</span>，使</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((p(j(0)),\\ldots,p(j(m-1))),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((p(j(0)),\\ldots,p(j(m-1))),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{H}(\\Gamma,p,k)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np(k)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\np(k)\\in\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\n\\vee\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists j:m\\to k\\\n\\bigl(((p(j(0)),\\ldots,p(j(m-1))),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{H}(\\Gamma,p,k)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np(k)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\np(k)\\in\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\n\\vee\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists j:m\\to k\\\n\\bigl(((p(j(0)),\\ldots,p(j(m-1))),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{H}(\\Gamma,p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\wedge\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{H}(\\Gamma,p,k)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{H}(\\Gamma,p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\wedge\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{H}(\\Gamma,p,k)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists p\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{H}(\\Gamma,p)\\wedge\np:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\wedge p(n-1)=A\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists p\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{H}(\\Gamma,p)\\wedge\np:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\wedge p(n-1)=A\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定理集合和后承闭包为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathcal P_H}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H} A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathcal P_H}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H} A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\mathcal P_H}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H} A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\mathcal P_H}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H} A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异与整个形式系统\">9. 目标差异与整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_H=(\\mathcal P_H,\\operatorname{LineOK}_{H},\\operatorname{Proof}_{H},\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_H=(\\mathcal P_H,\\operatorname{LineOK}_{H},\\operatorname{Proof}_{H},\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它把 Hilbert 演算形式化为由公式公理参数和有限前提规则参数决定的行证明框架；这与 <code>006</code> 的固定 CPC 展示以及 <code>050</code> 的固定 Frege 模式系统均不同。</p>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Hilbert}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{H},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{H},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{H},\n|\\cdot|_{H},\n\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H},\n\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H},\n\\mathcal P_H,\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{H},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{H},\n\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathcal P_H},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\mathcal P_H},\n\\Delta_H\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Hilbert}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{H},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{H},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{H},\n|\\cdot|_{H},\n\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H},\n\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H},\n\\mathcal P_H,\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{H},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{H},\n\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_H},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathcal P_H},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{\\mathcal P_H},\n\\Delta_H\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含命题句法、显式类型的公理/规则参数、有限公式序列证明和可证关系；不含固定逻辑的语义、真值表、扩展变量或元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表与目标差异","text":"1. 符号表与目标差异","level":1},{"id":"2.-命题语言","text":"2. 命题语言","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-大小函数","text":"4. 大小函数","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理与规则参数","text":"5. 公理与规则参数","level":1},{"id":"6.-规则实例的显示形式","text":"6. 规则实例的显示形式","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异与整个形式系统","text":"9. 目标差异与整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{H}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{H}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{H}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{H}(A,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\sigma=\\sigma(p),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\sigma=\\operatorname{neg}(A\\sigma),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\sigma=\\operatorname{imp}(A\\sigma,B\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha^{H}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|_{H}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}\\to\\mathbb N","display":true},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{atom}(p)|=1,\\quad\n|\\operatorname{neg}(A)|=1+|A|,\\quad\n|\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)|=1+|A|+|B|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{H},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}^{n}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_H=(\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H},\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}).","display":true},{"tex":"((A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}),B)\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H},","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{A_0\\qquad\\cdots\\qquad A_{n-1}}{B}.","display":true},{"tex":"((),B)\\in\\mathsf{RulePar}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AxPar}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\math